  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU MDG Initiative in Tanzania - Urban Water Supply and Sanitation Interventions in Kigoma, Lindi and Sumbawanga Towns</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the data available the three towns have a water supply coverage that ranges from 39% to 46% and access rates to sanitation vary between 24% and 41%.The purpose of intervention is to guarantee access to water supply services to 502,000 additional people in the three selected towns and access to sanitation services to 144,000 additional inhabitants.</narrative>
  </description>
